===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|palooka|ville|t1=a stupid or oafish person}}. Popularized in ''{{w|On the Waterfront}}'' (1954).

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|US}} An [[imaginary]] [[town]], the natural home of the [[mediocre]] and [[incompetent]].
