#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Rachel Saltz|title=Living in a Material World|work=The New York Times|date=2012-09-07|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/movies/desperate-endeavors-directed-by-salim-khassa.html|issn=0362-4331|passage=Ram’s descent plays out against a backdrop of New York as '''Palookaville''', full of free-floating hostility and natives who spout movie-bred clichés.}}

